  success summary), privileged IOS ping behavior, service/journal snapshots,
  and persistence checks. Do not reuse its raw guest control socket from the
  Mac; M4 must follow M3's browser-equivalent host boundary.
- Reuse `dialControlWS`/`controlWSClient.request` for string request ids,
  correlation, unsolicited event filtering, and request errors. Continue to
